yed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mending","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"non-magical object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NLXhQ24QHmA7BXMG","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"2":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}},"3":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"13JR9stmfknrdOvU","name":"Mending","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mending.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You repair the target item. You restore 5 Hit Points per spell level to the target, potentially removing the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.6dNUvdb1dhToNDj3]{Broken} condition if this repairs it past the item's Broken Threshold. You can't replace lost pieces or repair an object that's been completely destroyed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target a non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mending","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"non-magical object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NLXhQ24QHmA7BXMG","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"2":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}},"3":{"target":{"value":"non-magical object of 2 Bulk or less, or a magical object of 1 Bulk or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ytshIPrMzRQSvtTU","name":"Pest Form","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/pest-form.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You transform into the battle form of a Tiny animal, such as a cat, insect, lizard, or rat. You can decide the specific type of animal (such as a rat or praying mantis), but this has no effect on the form's Size or statistics. While in this form, you gain the animal trait. You can Dismiss the spell.</p>\n<p>You gain the following statistics and abilities:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AC = 15 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.</li>\n<li>Speed 10 feet.</li>\n<li>Weakness 5 to physical damage. (If you take physical damage in this form, you take 5 additional damage.)</li>\n<li>Low-light vision and imprecise scent 30 feet.</li>\n<li>Acrobatics and Stealth modifiers of +10, unless your own modifier is higher; Athletics modifier -4.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can turn into a flying creature, such as a bird, which grants you a fly Speed of 20 feet.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.ydsLEGjY89Akc4oZ]{Spell Effect: Pest Form}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"pest-form","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","polymorph"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NLXhQ24QHmA7BXMG","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gfPjmG6Fe6D3MFjl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"15l1C9RcSEZ6NnQG","name":"Pest Form","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/pest-form.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You transform into the battle form of a Tiny animal, such as a cat, insect, lizard, or rat. You can decide the specific type of animal (such as a rat or praying mantis), but this has no effect on the form's Size or statistics. While in this form, you gain the animal trait. You can Dismiss the spell.</p>\n<p>You gain the following statistics and abilities:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AC = 15 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.</li>\n<li>Speed 10 feet.</li>\n<li>Weakness 5 to physical damage. (If you take physical damage in this form, you take 5 additional damage.)</li>\n<li>Low-light vision and imprecise scent 30 feet.</li>\n<li>Acrobatics and Stealth modifiers of +10, unless your own modifier is higher; Athletics modifier -4.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> You can turn into a flying creature, such as a bird, which grants you a fly Speed of 20 feet.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.ydsLEGjY89Akc4oZ]{Spell Effect: Pest Form}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"pest-form","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","polymorph"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"10 minutes","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NLXhQ24QHmA7BXMG","heightenedLevel":1},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gfPjmG6Fe6D3MFjl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ikoGvc9f8QefNJCy","name":"Read Aura","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/read-aura.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical, and if it is, you learn the school of magic.</p>\n<p>If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's level is lower than the level of your read aura spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"read-aura","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 object"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 Minute"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"NLXhQ24QHmA7BXMG"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"10 objects"}},"6":{"target":{"value":"any number of objects"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OhD2Z6rIGGD5ocZA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gPIuZTfcv7yRhcQr","name":"Galtzagorri Hook Spear","type":"weapon","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/trident.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A galtzagorri hook spear is a spear with three hooked tines at the end, reminiscent of a longer trident and built to disarm foes and take advantage of a galtzagorri's dexterous movements.</p>\n<p>A dexterous hook spear is an uncommon martial melee weapon in the spear weapon group that deals 1d6 piercing damage and has the disarm, finesse, sprite, and thrown 20 feet traits.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["disarm","finesse","sprite","thrown-20"],"rarity":"uncommon"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":0},"quantity":1,"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":1},"hp":{"value":0,"max":0},"hardness":0,"price":{"value":{"gp":2}},"equipped":{"carryType":"held","invested":null,"handsHeld":1},"containerId":"null","size":"med","material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"identification":{"status":"identified","unidentified":{"name":"Unusual Weapon","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/unidentified_item_icons/weapon.webp","data":{"description":{"value":""}}},"misidentified":{}},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"category":"martial","group":null,"bonus":{"value":0},"damage":{"dice":1,"die":"d6","damageType":"piercing","persistent":null,"value":""},"splashDamage":{"value":0},"range":null,"expend":null,"ammo":null,"reload":{"value":"-"},"grade":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"striking":0,"property":[]},"specific":null,"subitems":[],"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"property1":{"value":"","dice":0,"die":"","damageType":"","critDice":0,"critDie":"","critDamage":"","critDamageType":"","strikeConditionType":"","strikeConditionValue":null,"criticalConditionType":"","criticalConditionValue":null},"ability":{"value":"str"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Item.gIw8yst6N42YEWzY","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":35,"temp":0,"max":35,"details":""},"ac":{"value":17,"details":"","base":17},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","label":"Fly","value":15}],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":3}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":""},"level":{"value":2},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Galtzagorri are diminutive, fretful humanoids native to the realm of the fey. They wear baggy, bright red pants and sport ladybug-like wings on their bare backs. Whether in flight or on foot, galtzagorri flit about with purpose, zigzagging between trees and buildings with equal ease. On the Material Plane, galtzagorri tend to avoid big cities but might be found in woodland settlements or any heavily forested area that resembles their wild home.</p>\n<p>For a galtzagorri, unemployment is a fate worse than death. Its nimble fingers twitching with anticipation, an unoccupied galtzagorri is prone to buzz about the land in search of overworked artisans, beleaguered farmers, and frazzled spellcasters eager to delegate their menial tasks. Once bonded to a skilled practitioner or spellcaster, a galtzagorri goes about any task, big or small, with enthusiasm, from tinkering with a malfunctioning construct to washing the windows. Galtzagorri are also helpful in battle, all too eager to swiftly disarm and disassemble their enemies' weapons.</p>\n<p>While its bonded master may initially see the creature as a blessing, a galtzagorri's relentless industriousness can also be a curse. An underworked galtzagorri quickly becomes agitated, undoing with frenetic anxiety the tasks it has already completed. If completely idle, it may even sabotage simple mechanical devices only so that it can fix them again. An artisan or spellcaster can rid themselves of an unwanted galtzagorri by trapping it in a small box and gifting it to another who may need the creature's \"help.\"</p>\n<h2>Galtzagorri Possessions</h2>\n<p>Money and ownership are so inconsequential to a galtzagorri that it would have no qualms about scratching a priceless jewel in an effort to fix a twisted prong. Any galtzagorri missing its oversized red pants-its one prized possession-has presumably sacrificed them in the name of completing some exceptionally satisfying task.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Galtzagorri Hunter Creature 2 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 5/12/22 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> armor (light), skill items (Acrobatics, Arcana, Athletics, Crafting, Deception, Stealth, Thievery)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), intelligence, sensory (low-light vision), spells (Primal: mending, pest form, read aura), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Dave Breitmaier","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":0},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":1},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":0},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":7,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":7,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":9,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":5,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":7},"athletics":{"base":6,"special":[{"label":"to Disarm","base":8,"predicate":["action:disarm"]}]},"arcana":{"base":8},"crafting":{"base":10},"deception":{"base":8},"stealth":{"base":9},"thievery":{"base":9}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","fey","sprite"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"tiny"}},"customModifiers":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":0.5,"width":0.5,"disposition":-1,"name":